===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|scorpiōn}}, {{m|de|schorpiōn}}, relatinised variants of older {{m|de|schorpe}}, from {{der|de|goh|scorpio}}, from {{der|de|la|scorpio}}, from {{der|de|grc|σκορπίων}}, variant of {{m|grc|σκορπίος}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/skɔrˈpi̯oːn/|[skɔʁˈpjoːn]|[skɔɐ̯-]|[skɔ-]|[-piˈoːn]}}
* Trisyllabic pronunciation is very rare. 
* {{audio|de|De-Skorpion.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||Skorpione|pl2=Skorpionen}}

# [[scorpion]] (arachnid of order [[Scorpiones]])

====Usage notes====
* The predominant plural is {{m|de||Skorpione}}. The form {{m|de||Skorpionen}} is now rare in edited prose, but may still be heard as a variant in speech.

